name: Completed actual Review retains uncertainty, observation history and exact spending
size: 120x36
cwd: @TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE KUZUSHI_AGENT_MCPS NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TARGET/../home KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/live_application_review_receipts.py @TARGET @ART initial
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: campaign live-application-review-20261015
require-live-snap: 25 1 completed | completed-review
expect: work finished
expect-not: L resume
nav-mode:
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 SELECTED JOB | review-job
expect: gpt-6-luna
resize: 160x48
live-snap: job-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: job-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: job-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: job-60x20
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 20 Jobs: 1 · 1 completed | job-40x12
ask: Does the completed real Review remain one consumed job, with the exact selected model and no resume action, across terminal sizes?
resize: 120x36
submit: campaign live-application-scans-20261015
require-live-snap: 25 3 completed | original-discovery
nav-mode:
keys: o
require-live-snap: 25 BATCH OCCURRENCE | recurrence
expect: seen 3 / completed 3
submit: findings
require-live-snap: 25 Viewing Review | review-list
nav-mode:
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 recorded: needs_review · auto | automatic-opinion
expect: needs_review
expect: needs-runtime
ask: Is the low-confidence automated opinion distinguishable from human decisions, recurrence and runtime proof, while the finding stays open?
submit: report
require-live-snap: 25 4 committed / 5 calls | report
expect: 1 protected review remaining
expect: 3 producer observations
expect: 0 reviewed
require-live-snap: 25 format json (4/6) | json-format
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 EXPORTED | exported
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/live_application_review_receipts.py @TARGET @ART exported
ask: Does Report preserve unknown dollars, three observations and the needs-review opinion without presenting unused Review capacity as another approved job?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TARGET/../home KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
submit: campaign live-application-review-20261015
require-live-snap: 25 1 completed | recovered-review
submit: campaign live-application-scans-20261015
require-live-snap: 25 3 completed | recovered-discovery
submit: report
require-live-snap: 25 4 committed / 5 calls | recovered-report
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/live_application_review_receipts.py @TARGET @ART restarted
ask: Does no-color restart retain both completed plans, the automated opinion and exact request counts without new work?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
